  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The initial pressure and volume of an ideal gas are<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>. The final pressure of the gas when the gas is suddenly compressed to volume<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> will be:</p><p>(Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi></math>= ratio of specific heats at constant pressure and at constant volume.)</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></msup></math></p>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#947;</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>As the gas is suddenly compressed the process is adiabatic.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>constant</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>&#947;</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#947;</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>&#947;</mi></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p></blockquote>"
